sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant W as Wake Word
    participant A as Avatar
    participant S as STT
    participant AI as AI Assistant
    participant T as TTS
    participant WG as Widgets

    U->>W: "Hey Bayit"
    W->>A: Activate (listening state)
    A-->>U: Avatar appears

    U->>S: "Movies with Ice?"
    S->>AI: Transcript
    AI->>AI: Search content
    AI->>T: "Here are 3 movies..."
    AI->>WG: Create movie widgets
    T-->>U: Voice response
    WG-->>U: Movie list displayed

    U->>S: "Play Berko & Segal"
    S->>AI: Transcript
    AI->>AI: Resolve podcast
    AI->>WG: Create podcast widget
    AI->>WG: Auto-play episode
    T-->>U: "Playing latest episode"
